// Silas Brandt, the Stacks superintendent and rumour collector (a mentor candidate; the Act I choice is made here).
npc: silas
name: Silas Brandt
trust: yes
start: minor [flag:mentor, !flag:mentor=silas]
start: back [flag:met_silas]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_silas}
  silas (warm): "New face on the stairs! Silas Brandt, I keep this building, which is a polite way of saying I know whose pipe leaks onto whom. You are the one who came down the chute. Everyone knows. Nobody is supposed to."
  > "What do you hear?" -> hear
  > "How do I stay out of trouble here?" -> trouble
  > "Wren sent me." -> wren

node: hear
  silas (conspiratorial): "Oh, the usual. A cat is missing and Teeter is beside himself. Dov at the Permit Hall is in love with a form. The hackers have fallen out again. I could go on. I usually do."
  > "How do I stay out of trouble here?" -> trouble
  > "Wren sent me." -> wren
  > [flag:wren_vouched, flag:met_ines, flag:met_maren, flag:met_tobias, flag:met_silas, !flag:mentor] "Will you help me get out of the city?" {flag:mentor=silas} -> arc_vouch
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: trouble
  on_enter: {+clue:curfew_hours(silas), +clue:auditor_night(silas), +clue:null_checker_loop(silas)}
  silas: "Three things. Curfew is ten at night until six; anyone with a record who is caught out in it gets marked. At night the Wardens go home to be updated, and that is when the Auditors come out, which is worse. And a Checker will stand and stare at a person with no record forever; it will not hurt you, it will just never let you go."
  > "That is useful." -> more
  > "Why are you telling me this?" -> why

node: why
  silas (soft): "Because Wren vouches for you, and because I would rather someone walked out of this building than was carried."
  > "Thank you." {trust:silas+1(helped by him)} -> more

node: more
  silas: "And the wall in the laundry. There is a panel by the machines and a fuse board behind it. You turn them until they are all dark. Wren will want to meet you."
  on_enter: {+clue:safehouse_way_in(silas)}
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: wren
  silas (pleased): "Wren! Good. Then you will want the wall in the laundry. A panel by the machines and a fuse board behind it; turn the fuses until they are all dark."
  on_enter: {+clue:safehouse_way_in(silas), +clue:laundry_key(silas)}
  > "What do you hear?" -> hear
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  silas (warm): "Back again! Mind the third step."
  > "What do you hear?" -> hear
  > "How do I stay out of trouble here?" -> trouble
  > [flag:wren_vouched, flag:met_ines, flag:met_maren, flag:met_tobias, flag:met_silas, !flag:mentor] "Will you help me get out of the city?" {flag:mentor=silas} -> arc_vouch
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: minor
  silas (warm): "Oh, you chose! I heard already, naturally. No hard feelings, love; the tea is always on."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: goodbye
  silas: "Keep your head down and your ears up."
  end
